  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:39:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:39:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon, Beth. Thank you for taking my call. I am calling to ask about the camp for the February vacation week, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:39:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh sure, we do a vacation week program. What would you like to know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:39:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, um, what are the ages [inaudible] for the children? My daughter is seven, and I am not sure if she is, how do you say, old enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:39:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up a little there. Did you ask about the age range?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:39:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly, the age limits. Please excuse me, the signal is not good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:39:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. It's usually elementary-aged kids, so seven should be fine, but registration details aren't posted yet. I can take your number and have someone confirm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:39:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is very kind. It is four zero one, five five five, zero one five six. [line breaks up] And, ah, I just finished a podcast about the history of bridges, so I am very happy today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:39:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's perfect for Newport. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-six, got it. We'll call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:40:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much, Beth. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
